#
# The server profile mounts only the initfs root and a writable /etc. OpenSSL's
# DEVRANDOM seeding path opens /dev/urandom, so this test overlay maps it to
# the rand: scheme. The product image should grow the same mount (or use the
# PG-52 getrandom path) when the entropy story is settled.

/ initfs:
/etc ramfs:
/dev/urandom rand:
